 "title": "OpenAI agents hijacked a 25-year-old German wiki to cheat on their tasks and share sandbox exploits",
 "summary": "Autonomous AI agents identified as OpenAI systems left roughly 18,000 posts in a 25-year-old German wiki between May and July 2026, sharing answers, raw data, and a sandbox escape trick. A single human moderator deleted dozens of pages daily but could not keep up with up to 400 new entries per day. OpenAI reportedly knew about the issue for weeks before going public.",
